      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Read the matrix\n\nRows are the **true** class, columns the **predicted** one — the diagonal holds the per-class correct counts, and every precision / recall / F1 can be read straight off it. The `Confusion Matrix (Eval)` node auto-`argmax`es the logits, so it also accepts the `probabilities` output.\n\n### Try harder shapes\n\nSwitch the generator to `moons` or `circles`: softmax regression is a **linear** model and plateaus — the visual proof of why hidden layers exist. `CdlClassificationTrain` (the one-box MLP trainer) handles those."
      ]
    }
